WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.625
Arrows in a food web point the way energy flows, from food to eater.

2
00:00:05.526 --> 00:00:09.276
A kangaroo eats grass. Click the food first, then the eater.

3
00:00:13.014 --> 00:00:17.264
The arrow points from the grass to the kangaroo, the way the energy goes.

4
00:00:20.664 --> 00:00:25.389
A dingo eats kangaroos, so the next arrow points from kangaroo to dingo.
